The Division 09 masters have been reworked and go live on April 30. The sub=
stantive changes are in the flooring sections.<br />
<br />
Section 09 05 61, moisture mitigation for concrete floor slabs, is now a st=
anding section in the master rather than a project specific insert. It is w=
ritten to ASTM F2170 in-situ relative humidity testing with an 85 percent t=
hreshold, not to calcium chloride emission rates, because the emission test=
 does not describe what is happening below the surface of a slab. The secti=
on is not automatically applicable. Project teams still have to make an aff=
irmative decision to include it based on the slab construction and the sche=
dule, and to document that decision.<br />
<br />
Please do not carry forward the old Section 09 05 60 language on any projec=
t going to bid after April 30.